OL,3,GNEWSABody found in search for man who
OL,4,Afell overboard from ferry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe body of a missing ferry passenger
OL,7,Fwho fell overboard has been found on a
OL,8,Fbeach in North Ayrshire.
OL,10,FHM Coastguard responded to a report of
OL,11,Fa man going overboard from the MV
OL,12,FCaledonian Isles near Arran about 20:30
OL,13,Fon Sunday 18 October.
OL,15,FThe man was later named as 82-year-old
OL,16,FJim Wither, who was reported missing
OL,17,Ffrom Johnstone, Renfrewshire.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
