OL,3,GNEWSABody found in search for man who
OL,4,Afell overboard from ferry
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland earlier received a
OL,7,Freport that the body of a man had been
OL,8,Ffound in the Largs beach area on
OL,9,FSunday. Formal identification has yet
OL,10,Fto take place, but the family of Jim
OL,11,FWither has been informed.
